{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4169, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3932, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4174, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f1c3f385f8f1f94bf1acf0faf184f7d1", "baseline_text": "즐겁게 해 보자고…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "楽しくやろうぜ……", "pointer_offset": 3936, "unit": "dialogue:c24dbec9fde29fde", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 5397, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff99cf64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf1488144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//내 패가//보너스 패야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//アタシのパイが//ボーナスパイだよ。", "pointer_offset": 3940, "unit": "dialogue:d2c82f2569369378", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4244, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff0cf81442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1f15ff957f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제다．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞추는 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題だ。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえるんだ。", "pointer_offset": 3944, "unit": "dialogue:af9f0dc384550541", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 5434, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0fa8143f0d8f2caf7d12f2ff19cf944f5f3f0c7f0d3f1448148", "baseline_text": "자，그럼…//내가 딜러인가？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さあて……//アタシが親か。", "pointer_offset": 3948, "unit": "dialogue:c8e0231fd2e3cea1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 5461, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f290f8aef14b81442f2ff0f0f944f5f3f0c7f1488144", "baseline_text": "빨리 해．//네가 딜러야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はやくしな。//アンタが親だよ。", "pointer_offset": 3952, "unit": "dialogue:856be9de53961500", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4357, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0b5f268f8f3f1c3f1c8f3d2f15a81442f2ff56ff9d4f144f1d0f0b5f1c72f2ff2b6f0dffac0f26af0e2f94bf1e2f0a48144", "baseline_text": "오늘은 즐거웠어．//돈만 가져오면//언제든 상대해 주지．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今日は楽しかったぜ。//金さえもってくれば//いつでも相手してやるよ。", "pointer_offset": 3956, "unit": "dialogue:6b4163b78fe30529", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 5262, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f7d1f66681432f2ff0d0f0aff144f947f1cdf0b2f8b1f1a9f198f257f2618144", "baseline_text": "…쳇，//돌아가서 술이나 한잔할까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……チッ、//帰って一杯やるか。", "pointer_offset": 3960, "unit": "dialogue:b3e35a28f809484c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4455, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0b1fa82f1e1f35af0a2f9b2f0a5f0cff0b8f7d12f2ff0dff2d1f0d3f18d8148", "baseline_text": "나랑 맞먹으려 하다니…//제법인데？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アタシとタメ張るなんざ……//なかなかやるじゃないか。", "pointer_offset": 3964, "unit": "dialogue:2b29d488863aad09", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4508, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3968, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4531, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3972, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4554, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0dcf0aef15a81432f2ff491f0a5f0d7f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "클리어，//축하합니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "クリアー、//おめでとうございまーす！", "pointer_offset": 3976, "unit": "dialogue:61e636574c02b17a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4591, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca81432f2ff27bf15cf14bf947f1c3fac6f1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，//계속해서 즐겨 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "では、//続けてお楽しみください！", "pointer_offset": 3980, "unit": "dialogue:d088a9520ee26497", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4624, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0affb74f0b1f2822f2ff2d5f293fa57f0c6f0f7f8b2f154f0cff1c7f7d12f2ff56cf6c3f3498144", "baseline_text": "아직 나랑//승부할 생각이 있다면…//덤벼봐．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まだアタシと//勝負する気があるのなら……//かかってきな。", "pointer_offset": 3984, "unit": "dialogue:7fcbd403e829d27b", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4681, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f2cef455f7d12f2ff25af8f4fb60fa81f263f0aef957f153f0faf168f0b181442f2ff0d8fa62f1528143f1cff0aff14b8144", "baseline_text": "후훗…//너도 참 못 말리는 남자구나．//그런 점，좋아해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふふ……//アンタもこりない男だな。//そういうの、好きだよ。", "pointer_offset": 3988, "unit": "dialogue:b12dc86106c76dce", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 5295, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "f7d1f385f0b2f0a8f8f4f9aef1c8f29c81482f2ff18ef263f0b2f0a4f7d1f2d5f293fa57f0c6f0f7f8b2f1b5f0cff1c781432f2ff28dfb68f0d0f0aff144f0a8f1848144", "baseline_text": "…겁이라도 난 거냐？//정말이지…승부할 생각이 없다면，//얼른 돌아가라고．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……怖気づいたのか？//ったく……勝負しないなら、//さっさと帰りな。", "pointer_offset": 3992, "unit": "dialogue:b782b43ea9c0fc17", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0017", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 4807, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0b5f268f8f3f1c3f1c8f3d2f15a81442f2ff56ff9d4f144f1d0f0b5f1c72f2ff2b6f0dffac0f26af0e2f94bf1e2f0a48144", "baseline_text": "오늘은 즐거웠어．//돈만 가져오면//언제든 상대해 주지．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今日は楽しかったぜ。//金さえもってくれば//いつでも相手してやるよ。", "pointer_offset": 3996, "unit": "dialogue:6b4163b78fe30529", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN#0018", "file": "MINIGAME/JT11LOBE.SBN", "offset": 5364, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f7d1f66681432f2ff0d0f0aff144f947f1cdf0b2f8b1f1a9f198f257f2618144", "baseline_text": "…쳇，//돌아가서 술이나 한잔할까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……チッ、//帰って一杯やるか。", "pointer_offset": 4000, "unit": "dialogue:b3e35a28f809484c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
